  "content": "```html\n<h3><strong>此模组彻底重做了矿车，尤其是熔炉矿车。</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/bar.png?raw=true\" alt=\"bar\">  </p>\n<h1><strong>🚂 功能特色</strong></h1>\n<h2><strong>🔗 链接机制</strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 使用铁链或铜链将矿车连接在一起。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 与其他模组不同，您可以使用所有类型的链条，且铜链会随氧化而松动。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 潜行并右键点击每个矿车以进行连接。大多数交互中顺序并不重要。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 熔炉矿车始终位于列车前方，因此不能放置在中间或尾部。</span></p>\n<h2><strong>♨️ 高炉矿车</strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 替代原版物品“熔炉矿车”。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 全新模型与GUI燃料条，显示剩余燃料量。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 熔炉矿车速度比其他矿车快一倍，动力轨道对其依然有效。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 可使用任何燃料驱动，用水桶可立即关闭。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 每次交互均有粒子与音效效果，提升体验：)</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 原版名称与配方已正确更新。</span></p>\n<h2><strong>💥 碰撞效果</strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 高速矿车造成击退和伤害，轻松碾过烦人的怪物！</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 伤害随挂载矿车数量增加。七辆矿车的编队可消灭大多数敌人。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 盔甲、附魔及药水可减少碰撞伤害。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 可在配置文件中关闭该功能。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/bar.png?raw=true\" alt=\"bar\">  </p>\n<h1><strong>⚙️ 配置选项</strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">✦ 开启/关闭链接机制。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">✦ 开启/关闭碰撞伤害。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">✦ 设置熔炉燃烧时间（默认：72000）。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">✦ 设置熔炉矿车最大速度（默认：每秒32格）。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">✦ 设置其他矿车的最大速度（默认：每秒16格）。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">✦ 设置链条承受距离（默认断裂距离为4格）。</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">✦ 设置各级链条距离（默认：1.2 | 1.6 | 2 | 2.6 | 3.2格）。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/bar.png?raw=true\" alt=\"bar\">  </p>\n<h2>✨🌐 <strong>完整语言支持</strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>本模组现已支持全部142种Minecraft语言：</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 熔炉矿车将在您的语言中显示正确名称</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- \"被矿车击杀\"消息已翻译</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/bar.png?raw=true\" alt=\"bar\"><br>\n<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><em>查看我的其他模组：</em></strong></span></p>\n<p>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ultimate-horseshoes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/ultimate_horseshoes.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ULTIMATE HORSESHOES\"></a>     <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ultimate-key-lock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/ultimate_key_lock.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ULTIMATE KEY LOCK\"></a></p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frost-lava-walker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/frost_lava_walker.png?raw=true\" alt=\"FROST LAVA WALKER\"></a>     <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ultimate-map-atlases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/ultimate_map_atlases.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ULTIMATE MAP ATLASES\"></a></p>\n<p>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ultimate-better-bells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/ultimate_better_bells.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ULTIMATE BETTER BELLS\"></a>     <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ultimate-villager-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/ultimate_villager_armor.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ULTIMATE VILLAGER ARMOR\"></a></p>\n<p>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ultimate-battle-music\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/ultimate_battle_music.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ULTIMATE BATTLE MUSIC\"></a>     <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ultimate-location-music\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nanakytim/host_image/blob/Main/ultimate_location_music.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ULTIMATE LOCATION MUSIC\"></a></p>\n```",
